      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Waiting like that is its own kind of prison, and it makes sense that it feels exhausting. But even in the lingering, you're still making choices—like reaching out here, or noticing your own breath. That's a quiet form of agency, even if it doesn't look like the freedom you crave. You don't have to have all the answers today; just being here, in this moment, is enough.",
